cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: "DeepOpenCRISPR-1: sequence-only activity prediction for OpenCRISPR-1 guide RNAs"
abstract: >-
  A deep-learning regressor that predicts OpenCRISPR-1 guide-RNA editing
  activity (day 7, %) from sequence alone, together with conventional ML
  baselines and a replicate-based variance analysis.
